{
  "uid": "k8s-state",
  "title": "Kubernetes State",
  "tags": [
    "kubernetes",
    "kube-state-metrics",
    "generated"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "CronJobs \u2014 the pillar that was missing",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Time since last successful run",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max by (namespace,cronjob) (kube_cronjob_status_last_successful_time)",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{cronjob}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 90000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 172800
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Value",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "THE PANEL THIS DASHBOARD EXISTS FOR. On 2026-09-09 two backup CronJobs were found broken by hand: wanderer-backup had NEVER succeeded since deployment, and donetick-backup had been deadlocked for 42 hours under concurrencyPolicy: Forbid, where a hung job blocks every successor permanently. trails.bradpenney.io returned 200 throughout both. No HTTP probe can see this; nothing in the fleet could report it until kube-state-metrics was deployed (ADR-155).\n\nAmber at ~25h, red at 48h \u2014 sized for daily schedules. A cell that is red and CLIMBING is a job that will never recover on its own."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Job failures (last 6h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace,job_name) (kube_job_status_failed > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{job_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Distinct from the panel beside it. A job that fails FAST shows here and keeps the staleness clock ticking there; a job that HANGS shows only there. Both happened, in the same namespace, on the same night."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Workloads",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Deployments short of desired replicas",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "kube_deployment_spec_replicas - kube_deployment_status_replicas_available > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{deployment}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Value",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Empty is the healthy state. A Deployment can report Ready while short a replica, which is exactly the shape of a topology constraint that cannot be satisfied."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Container restarts per hour",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace,pod) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total[1h])) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "A crash-looping pod that recovers between checks is invisible to any point-in-time probe."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Pods not Running",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_status_phase{phase!=\"Running\",phase!=\"Succeeded\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}} {{phase}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Value",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Pending here for more than a moment usually means quota, affinity, or an RWO volume attached elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Storage \u2014 two sources, because neither sees everything",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PVC used % (kubelet \u2014 MOUNTED volumes only)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace,persistentvolumeclaim) (kubelet_volume_stats_used_bytes / kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{persistentvolumeclaim}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Feeds the pvc-nearly-full alert (>75% for 15m).\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f BLIND SPOT, stated rather than discovered later: kubelet reports a volume only while a pod on that node has it MOUNTED. A PVC used by a short-lived CronJob is absent between runs \u2014 measured 2026-09-10, four PVCs existed and three had series. The Longhorn panel beside this one is what covers that gap."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Longhorn disk usage per node",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (longhorn_disk_usage_bytes / longhorn_disk_capacity_bytes))",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} {{disk}} free %",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "longhorn_volume_robustness",
          "legendFormat": "{{volume}} robustness",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Longhorn reports the underlying disks and every volume it manages regardless of whether anything has it mounted \u2014 the half kubelet cannot see. volume_robustness: 0=unknown 1=healthy 2=degraded 3=faulted."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Nodes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Node conditions that are not Ready",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "kube_node_status_condition{condition!=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} {{condition}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Value",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "MemoryPressure, DiskPressure, PIDPressure. Empty is healthy. These precede an eviction rather than reporting one."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pods per node",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (node) (kube_pod_info)",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "The placement-gate failure made visible. server2 has carried 40 of 47 scheduled pods on 4.6 GiB allocatable while server1 sat nearly empty on 34.5 GiB (ADR-137/142)."
    }
  ],
  "description": "Object STATE \u2014 what the cluster INTENDS versus what it has. cadvisor reports usage and the kubelet reports volumes; neither can say a CronJob last succeeded three days ago, which is how two broken backups went unnoticed. Requires kube-state-metrics. Built 2026-09-10."
}
